              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "پسرعمو (pesar'amu) — \"a paternal cousin (son of a father's brother)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "پسرعمویم با من همکلاسی است. pesar'amuyam bâ man hamkelâsi ast. My cousin is in my class."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "pesar 'son' + 'amu. Persian names each cousin by the parent: dokhtar'amme, pesardâyi and so on."
            }
          ]
        },
