          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "pesar'amu is built in Persian on native pesar, 'son', and 'amu, which comes from Arabic ʿamm, 'paternal uncle' (EtymDB)."
